word: Every knee will bend to me, and every tongue will confess allegiance
to me. (Isa 45:23 NLT) Everyone will eventually bow to the Lordship of
Jesus but the place they will be by the time they do is based on their
choice. It is better to release your choice right now and bow to His
Lordship in this lifetime.
God will achieve whatever He wants to, no matter how long it will take
and how many people He will have to pass over until He gets a willing
fit for each operation in the algorithm of the codes that needs to be in
place for His program to run. He will even create another person for the
specific purpose if at all there is no one among the billions on earth
exercising their choices in the direction he wants.

