                        ABOUT THE BOOK

In living a life of fulfilment and meaning, it is not just sufficient to know what to
do in life, it is important to know when to do it. A sequel to the book 'The Life
Assignment' by the same author, which answers the question of WHAT you are
 on earth to do, this book gives insights the question of WHEN. By reading this
book you will develop wisdom on how to live a fulfilled life by understanding and

                  aligning with accurate timing for each step of life.

